<title>JAPAN: Nippon Seisen - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Seisen - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.17		vs	   12.42</p>
<p> Operating	  228 million	 vs	  483 million</p>
<p> Current	    291 million	 vs	  454 million</p>
<p> Net		  144 million	 vs	  173 million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.15 yen	  vs	    6.19 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Seisen Co Ltd is a leading maker of secondary steel products.</p>
</text>
